% Safety is order-independent (spec §33): a negated literal written before the
% literal that binds its variable, and a comparison written before its binder,
% are both safe because the evaluator reorders the body (spec §35).
todo(a).
blocked(b).
size(a, 200).
ready(X) :- not blocked(X), todo(X).
big(X) :- N > 100, size(X, N).
